{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_20\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 20</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_20\">Problem 20</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 20\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/3/60361b8c53186db981f5c16332ea192bd65e6671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x+\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"79\" height=\"37\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a47a5fbaaadcb8a081432670337feb0d456015a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+x^3-4x^2+x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" /> becomes: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7c1c03e1884df3d08a2829b008f5078c2fba6b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x^2(y^2+y-2)=0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ x^2(y^2+y-3)=0\\\\  \\textbf{(C)}\\ x^2(y^2+y-4)=0 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ x^2(y^2+y-6)=0\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"392\" height=\"59\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717af8ba13fcf7b3fa778e0f484ff683b4f231f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+x^3-4x^2+x+1 = x^2\\left(x^2 + x - 4 + \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^2}\\right) = x^2\\left(x^2 + 2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} + x + \\frac{1}{x} - 6\\right) = x^2\\left(y^2+y-6\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"813\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We multiply each of the answers to get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69d068130b4edb4211b544613063dc500167c24b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2(y^2)+x^2(y)+nx^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/2/352a1896128955620eb1d03c54db75d8b216c41e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2,-3,-4,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/3683f227b0b53e6a30087db2fa3b752965ecf05d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-6$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />. Looking at the first term, we have to square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd63778e2e70f659ed2af4adf5b463bd020156c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />, doing so, we get the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/0/1d07a14c52c2eb76fec995f54cf5f58686284924.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"37\" />. Multiplying that by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33e0edba921ac3190e3b56c57078388d9b7caa96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+2x^2+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />. Multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, we get the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aae20b975f3a291fd1fd8657eb08f6789f6a81d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />. Adding these two equations together, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/c/ebc73d50330712eaac64feb2963ff4bafa19148d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+x^3+2x^2+x+1+nx=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"247\" height=\"16\" />. To get the term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/4/744c35eed4b1d1259e33c73b9a7992f1ae8b449f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" />, which was in the original equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/3683f227b0b53e6a30087db2fa3b752965ecf05d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-6$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />, giving an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1953 AHSME Prob